ent":[{"type":"text","text":"The event’s stored properties, by name"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"request_ip"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"\"0.0.0.0\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", in RudderStack’s calls alone","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"timestamp"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When the event was tracked, in ISO 8601 with milliseconds, in UTC","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"type"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"\"track\"","type":"codeVoice"}]}]]]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The session is the only identifier sent: there is no "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"userId"},{"type":"text","text":", no "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"identify"},{"type":"text","text":" call, no traits,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and no "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"context.device.id"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"advertisingId"},{"type":"text","text":". An endpoint counts a user per "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"anonymousId"},{"type":"text","text":", so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its anonymous users are sessions. A record with no session (one tracked by a tracker without"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Enricher.sessions()"},{"type":"text","text":", or one a store recovered after a relaunch, which keeps no context) is its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"own anonymous user, linked to nothing: the spec rejects a call with neither a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"userId"},{"type":"text","text":" nor an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"anonymousId"},{"type":"text","text":". Segment deduplicates calls by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"messageId"},{"type":"text","text":" over about the last 24 hours, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"drops most duplicates rather than all, so a recovered record Segment had already stored before"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the app ended is most likely not stored again, whatever its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"anonymousId"},{"type":"text","text":". RudderStack’s and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Customer.io’s references don’t say whether they deduplicate. The record’s vendor identifier"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and trace context, and any other context value, aren’t sent."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"context.ip","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"0.0.0.0\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in every call, which the spec reads as the user’s address, so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Segment records no address from the request. RudderStack fills in a ","type":"text"},{"code":"request_ip","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" member from","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the request unless the call has one, even when ","type":"text"},{"code":"context.ip","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is set, and passes it on to its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"destinations, so RudderStack’s calls also carry ","type":"text"},{"code":"request_ip","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" as ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"0.0.0.0\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Customer.io’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"references don’t say whether ","type":"text"},{"code":"context.ip","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" takes the place of the address it reads from an HTTP","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"request. No call to Segment or Customer.io carries ","type":"text"},{"code":"request_ip","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", which their specs don’t have.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"No ","type":"text"},{"code":"sentAt","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"originalTimestamp","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"channel","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is sent. Without ","type":"text"},{"code":"sentAt","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" the endpoint takes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"timestamp","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" as it is, uncorrected for the device’s clock; it is left out on purpose, as a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"retried request sends the same body again, whose ","type":"text"},{"code":"sentAt","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" would be the first attempt’s.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"RudderStack, whose references list all three as required, fills them in from when it received","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the call.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Properties are read through the event’s schema in ","type":"text"},{"code":"plan","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", as ","type":"text"},{"code":"PropertyReader","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" reads them. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Sensitive"},{"text":" value is never sent, whatever the record reveals: the property is left","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"out, an element of an array is ","type":"text"},{"code":"null","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and one inside a type the plan can’t map is ","type":"text"},{"code":"null","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"context"},{"type":"text","text":" holds these members, for each of the keys the record’s context has a value for:"}]},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Member"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Key","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent